A growable sequence of bytes with a final zero byte.

Use alloc, core, and io.

A public record TcString has a data as a pointer to byte, a len as an unsigned number, and a cap as an unsigned number.

Publicly, to str_new returning TcString.
    Define local s as TcString.
    Give back s.
Done.

Publicly, to str_from_bytes given p as a pointer to byte, n as an unsigned number, returning TcString.
    Define local s as TcString.
    Set s.len to n.
    Set s.cap to n + 1.
    Set s.data to heap_alloc(s.cap).
    If n > 0:
        Copy n bytes from p to s.data.
    Set item n of s.data to 0.
    Give back s.
Done.

Publicly, to str_push_bytes given s as a pointer to TcString, p as a pointer to byte, n as an unsigned number, returning nothing.
    If n == 0:
        Give back.
    Define local needed as an unsigned number.
    Set needed to s.len + n + 1.
    If needed > s.cap:
        Define local new_cap as an unsigned number.
        Set new_cap to s.cap * 2.
        If new_cap < needed:
            Set new_cap to needed.
        If new_cap < 16:
            Set new_cap to 16 as an unsigned number.
        Define local old_cap as an unsigned number.
        Set old_cap to s.cap.
        Set s.data to heap_realloc(s.data, old_cap, new_cap).
        Set s.cap to new_cap.
    Copy n bytes from p to (s.data as an unsigned number + s.len) as a pointer to byte.
    Set s.len to s.len + n.
    Set item s.len of s.data to 0.
Done.

Publicly, to str_concat given a as a pointer to TcString, b as a pointer to TcString, returning TcString.
    Call this as "join <a> and <b>".
    Define local joined as TcString.
    Set joined to str_from_bytes(a.data, a.len).
    str_push_bytes(address of joined, b.data, b.len).
    Give back joined.
Done.

Publicly, to str_eq given a as a pointer to TcString, b as a pointer to TcString, returning a truth value.
    If a.len != b.len:
        Give back false.
    Give back mem_eq(a.data, b.data, a.len).
Done.

Publicly, to str_len given s as a pointer to TcString, returning an unsigned number.
    Call this as "length of <s>".
    Give back s.len.
Done.

Publicly, to str_clone given s as a pointer to TcString, returning TcString.
    Give back str_from_bytes(s.data, s.len).
Done.

Publicly, to str_clear given s as a pointer to TcString, returning nothing.
    Set s.len to 0 as an unsigned number.
    If s.data as an unsigned number != 0:
        Set item 0 of s.data to 0.
Done.

Publicly, to str_free given s as a pointer to TcString, returning nothing.
    If s.data as an unsigned number != 0:
        heap_free(s.data).
    Set s.data to no address.
    Set s.len to 0 as an unsigned number.
    Set s.cap to 0 as an unsigned number.
Done.

To newline returning nothing.
    Ask Linux kernel 1 with 1, "\n", and 1.
Done.

Publicly, to print_str given s as a pointer to TcString, returning nothing.
    You can call this as "say <s>", "show <s>", "print <s>", or "display <s>".
    If s.len > 0:
        Ask Linux kernel 1 with 1, s.data, and s.len.
    newline().
Done.
